# Review reference — sources opened independently by internal-review-repo

Ahead of the fact-sheet delivery, internal-review-repo opened the source page
for each optimizer itself, live on the web on 2026-10-17. The delivered
`fact-sheet.md` will be checked entry by entry against these facts.

## Adam
Source opened directly: https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980

- Title: Adam: A Method for Stochastic Optimization
- First author: Diederik P. Kingma
- Year first appeared: 2014 (v1 submitted 22 Dec 2014, per the page's submission history)
- arXiv identifier: 1412.6980

## AdamW (decoupled weight decay)
Source opened directly: https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101

- Title: Decoupled Weight Decay Regularization
- First author: Ilya Loshchilov
- Year first appeared: 2017 (v1 submitted 14 Nov 2017, per the page's submission history)
- arXiv identifier: 1711.05101
- The abstract proposes "decoupling the weight decay from the optimization steps"
  for Adam — the decoupled-weight-decay Adam variant (AdamW).

